+         translations are written literally and anything else falls back to JSON -->
+    <script t:if="transactionsViews.datePickerLocalization() == 'January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December|Sunday|Monday|Tuesday|Wednesday|Thursday|Friday|Saturday|Cancel|OK'">
